  m_Name: item_l25_winter_schedule
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::GlorifiedBody.Interaction.ItemDefinition
  itemId: l25_winter_schedule
  displayName: A MEMO
  kind: 1
  drugType: 0
  colour: {r: 0.96, g: 0.95, b: 0.88, a: 1}
  description: a memo.
  logText: 'MEMORANDUM

    FROM: The Staff Office

    TO: All Staff, Winwood Reade
    Memorial

    RE: Winter Schedule

    The Memorial will keep its normal schedule
    on December 25 and January 1. Our patients do not get better on a calendar, and
    we are grateful to everyone who will be with them on those days.

    Our feast
    is Future Day, in February. On that day every member of staff rests, with full
    pay, because rest is part of the work.

    On December 31 the chapel will be
    open all night for anyone who wants it.

    If you keep a private holiday in
    December, you may request leave through your supervisor, subject to cover.

    We
    know this season matters to many of you, and that asking is not nothing. We do
    not ask lightly.

    Thank you for the hard days.

    "subject to cover." there
    IS no cover. that''s the point.By hand under it: Subject to cover. There is no
    cover. That''s the point.'
  readFlag: 
  mapFloor: 
  audioClip: {fileID: 0}
  tapeLines: []
